Rectangular plot with approximately eight metres of western frontage and 22 metres depth. Registered acquisition describes three-storey row buildings numbered 137/5-6. Each unit has its own staircase. Ground floors are interconnected through the party wall; second and third floors are not connected. Verify alterations, plans and transfer inventory against actual condition.

Chaiyaphon Withi Road is public, with approximately 12 metres of asphalt carriageway and a 30-metre right of way. SAM reports orange zoning, residential/commercial surroundings and available utilities.

Material road-planning disclosure: SAM reports that the property lies within recommended planning-road alignment ฌ14. It also reports an enquiry to the Department of Highways'' Khao Mai Kaeo section stating no expropriation project for the road frontage at the time of that information. This is not an assurance against future expropriation or alignment changes. Verify current alignment and project status with the relevant authority before offering.

Source-listed nearby places are Wat Nop Thong Di Si Phruettharam (Wat Pong), Pong Subdistrict Health Promoting Hospital and Pong Municipality Office. From Rayong toward Pattaya on Highway 36, pass Splashdown Waterpark, SUSCO and PTT Pong, then turn left onto Highway 3240 for approximately 880 metres; the property is on the left.

Some exterior photos display 20 January 2025; the latest exterior/interior set displays 13 May 2026. Nineteen images include floors, stairs, bathrooms, balconies, floor plans, plot plans and map. Inspect current floors, walls, ceilings, power, plumbing and drainage.

SAM showed direct purchase and this price on 11 September 2026. Contact 02-686-1888, sales@sam.or.th or LINE @samline, quoting SL0148, to confirm availability, price, viewing, road alignment, buildings and terms.

